# github.com/docker/docker is pulled in transitively by testcontainers-go
# (build tag `integration` only). It is NOT compiled into the production
# binary (Dockerfile builds `go build .` with no integration tag), only
# into test binaries built locally and in CI for integration runs.
#
# All three CVEs below are tracked but cannot be remediated without
# breaking the integration test stack:
#
#   CVE-2026-34040: fixed in docker v29.3.1+, but v28/v29 removed the
#     archive.Compression type that testcontainers-go v0.35 depends on
#     (build breaks at github.com/docker/docker/pkg/archive).
#   CVE-2026-41567: status "affected" with no fix in any docker release.
#   CVE-2026-42306: status "affected" with no fix in any docker release.
#
# Re-evaluate when testcontainers-go releases a version compatible with
# docker v29+, or when these CVEs receive an upstream fix.
CVE-2026-34040
CVE-2026-41567
CVE-2026-42306
